---
/**
 * Visible placeholder for information the client still has to provide.
 * Renders "[À COMPLÉTER : <slot>]" highlighted, so missing content cannot go unnoticed.
 */
---

<mark class="to-complete">[À COMPLÉTER&nbsp;: <slot />]</mark>

<style>
  .to-complete {
    padding-inline: 0.2em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-field);
    background-color: var(--color-todo-bg);
    color: var(--color-todo-text);
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
  }
</style>
